{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>\u200bCorporate Judge: Ctrl+Alt-Get Even!\u200b</strong>\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This RPG Maker-crafted strategy game weaponizes your workplace trauma into cathartic combat. Experience the ultimate &quot;anti-hustle&quot; fantasy of toppling toxic CEOs and yeeting unreasonable deadlines into the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/\u98de\u4e6620240130-103635.gif?t=1744704521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u200bWarning to Under-35 Wage Slaves:\u200b</strong>\u200b May cause accidental deployment of sass during performance reviews. Handle with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>GamePlay: Tower of Druaga +\u00a0Persona</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gameplay blends <i>Tower of Druaga</i>'s tactical battles with <i>Persona</i>'s social mechanics, remixed with puzzle-solving (imagine rearranging Jira tickets), match-3 stress relief (combo those TPS reports!), and roguelike office politics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/CG\u63d2\u56fe1\u2014\u2014\u6237\u5ddd\u7ffc\u7ad9\u5728\u516c\u53f8\u697c\u9876.png?t=1744704521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>Story:\u00a0Rookie Programmer meets Mysterious Cat</i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Set in Cyber-Tokyo's corporate dystopia, you play as \u200b<strong>\u200bTogawa Tsubasa\u200b</strong>\u200b - a rookie programmer who accidentally sold her soul to Blackstone Corp. By day, she's a code monkey surviving micromanagement hell. By night, her consciousness rebels in the \u200b<strong>\u200bMidnight World\u200b</strong>\u200b after meeting Vita, a glitch-spewing cat who turns corporate jargon into combat spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/1.gif?t=1744704521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/\u7b54\u9898_5\u5e27\u7248\u672c.gif?t=1744704521\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Recruit fellow broken souls from accounting purgatory and HR hellscape. Weaponize their burnout as special abilities. Storm the C-suite labyrinth where your manager's &quot;culture-building exercises&quot; have literally summoned a KPI Demon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/extras/2.gif?t=1744704521\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2607260?t=1744704521","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/5129480478cf5a9ec3b93eccff58a6aacf625db5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744704521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/60dfacfce30221b0c1067aa27b80ac21e27a2530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744704521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2607260/60dfacfce30221b0c1067aa27b80ac21e27a2530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744704521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2758100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":